        "quote": "您理解得完全正确，我来逐条确认"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00497",
        "explanation": "Final teach-back: doctor confirms the family’s list of must-return signs and the plan to follow discharge paperwork.",
        "quote": "您的理解完全正确，放心按这个来"
      }
    ],
    "executable": true,
    "explanation": "The doctor obtained family receipt of the discharge plan, including specific danger signals to return, medication compliance, and follow-up appointments. No blocking residual risk remains; the family confirmed they will not self-modify treatment and will return if red flags appear.",
