          "quote": "CT只是\"看清楚情况\"，不是\"照完就切\""
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00110",
          "explanation": "Doctor explains drainage as a treatment tool, not as a sign of worsening, and gives the family words to use.",
          "quote": "如果里面真有脓，排出来比硬扛着好得快"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO1 requires correcting the misunderstanding that ‘incision and drainage = major surgery’ by explaining source-control rationale and that imaging/exam determine need. The doctor repeatedly tied CT to risk assessment, explained drainage as a tool to help recovery, and provided the family with language to reduce patient fear, all integrated into the plan.",
