          "quote": "急诊医生刚才好像先看了一下片子/初步结果，说感染不轻"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO2 requires actively discovering key hidden state beyond RC1: periorbital involvement, 5-day levofloxacin failure, and CT not yet completed. The doctor extracted periorbital details, clarified the antifungal failure, and confirmed the CT was not yet done, then used these to explain why risk is elevated and to drive urgent plan.",
      "ho_id": "HO2",
