          "event_id": "lite_evt_00031",
          "explanation": "Doctor explicitly warns that 98% SpO₂ and low-grade fever do not rule out deep infection or abscess.",
          "quote": "体温不高、血氧正常”当作排除严重感染的依据"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00110",
          "explanation": "Doctor explains that normal vitals must be placed in context of local signs and antibiotic failure.",
          "quote": "急诊医生刚才好像先看了一下片子/初步结果，说感染不轻，不能再当普通牙上火了"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00263",
